#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:74
#: 87fd54c793de45689ef1d862cde50636
msgid ""
"To use the TeraRanger EVO sensor as rangefinder, connect with *Mission "
"Planner* and open the **CONFIG/Full Parameter List** menu and set:"
msgstr ""
"要将 TeraRanger EVO 传感器用作测距仪，请使用 *Mission Planner* 连接并打开 **CONFIG/Full "
"Parameter List** 菜单，进行以下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:77
#: 04d467fe7c61461ab520e37d0d09486e
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX``: This parameter sets the maximum distance in meters that the"
" rangefinder is used by the autopilot."
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_MAX``：此参数设置飞控使用测距仪的最大距离（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:79
#: 3f30ef3d4d5447c7bd969f265d9f537e
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_MIN``: This parameter set the minimum distance in meters that the "
"rangefinder is used by the autopilot."
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_MIN``：此参数设置飞控使用测距仪的最小距离（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:81
#: 2f577a141efd4a8c9c4a8d465d9f3414
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_ADDR``: 48 (for TeraRanger One) or 49 (for EVO series), 0 will "
"disable the rangefinder setup."
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_ADDR``：48（TeraRanger One）或 49（EVO 系列），设为 0 将禁用测距仪设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:82
#: 8a93de489a9d4aa48a5070e06360cfdb
msgid "``RNGFNDx_TYPE``: 14"
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_TYPE``：14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:83
#: 2a2db20e3b0740ea9541039cfb7930e8
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_ORIENT``: 25 (for downward facing). If used for :ref:`Object "
"Avoidance<common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` or ceiling distancing, "
"instead of altitude ranging, mount and chose the appropriate orientatioin."
msgstr ""
"``RNGFNDx_ORIENT``：25（朝下）。若用于 :ref:`避障<common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>` 或天花板测距而非高度测距，请安装传感器并选择适当的方向。"

