#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:124
#: 02365e620bc144d28166588c536f4a97
msgid ""
"When the autopilot boots, the rangefinder needs to already be powered on, or"
" at least be powered on at the same time as the autopilot. If you power the "
"rangefinder after the autopilots has booted, it will not be recognized since"
" the autopilot will have already scanned its I2C bus for devices!"
msgstr ""
"飞控启动时，测距仪需要已经通电，或至少与飞控同时通电。若在飞控启动后才给测距仪供电，则测距仪将无法被识别，因为飞控已完成 I2C 总线的设备扫描！"
